From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dugs <dugahol@protonmail.com>
Date: Thu, 26 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: apple: t8015-d21: Name the Wi-Fi module

The D21's ADT wlan module-instance is "pegasuse". Set brcm,board-type
so brcmfmac looks for the D21's own firmware and NVRAM.

Assisted-by: LLM
Signed-off-by: Dugs <dugahol@protonmail.com>
---
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t8015-d21.dts	2026-11-26 00:29:38.369822921 +1030
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t8015-d21.dts	2026-11-26 00:29:51.660458357 +1030
@@ -69,3 +69,8 @@
 &touchclk {
 	clock-frequency = <32768>;
 };
+
+/* The D21's Wi-Fi module, as its ADT's wlan module-instance names it */
+&wifi0 {
+	brcm,board-type = "apple,pegasuse";
+};
